     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The masculine personal plural",
     "texto": [
      "For groups of men or mixed groups, Polish usually uses **ci** and adjectives ending in **-i/-y**: **ci młodzi ludzie**, «these young people».",
      "In English we say «the young people», but Polish marks this category on more words in the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about age",
     "texto": [
      "**Senior** is an older person; **seniorzy** is its masculine personal plural.",
      "**Międzypokoleniowy** relates people from different generations."
